---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout>
  <section class="mx-auto grid max-w-[1120px] gap-5 px-4 pt-24 pb-12">
    <p
      class="font-semibold tracking-wide text-[--color-supporting-green] uppercase"
    >
      Shopify & Adobe Commerce Development
    </p>
    <h1 class="m-0 text-[clamp(2rem,6vw,3.5rem)] leading-tight">
      Salt & Scale — <em>Growth, grounded in truth.</em>
    </h1>
    <p class="max-w-[62ch] text-[1.125rem]">
      We specialize in solving complex e‑commerce challenges using Shopify and
      Adobe Commerce. Whether you're scaling or enterprise, we architect, build,
      and optimize with integrity and measurable outcomes.
    </p>
    <div class="flex gap-3">
      <a
        href="#contact"
        class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-[--color-accent-brown] px-4 py-2 font-semibold text-white transition hover:opacity-90 active:translate-y-px"
        >Start a project</a
      >
      <a
        href="#services"
        class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-[rgba(55,62,69,0.2)] px-4 py-2 text-[--color-primary-navy]"
        >See services</a
      >
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="services" class="mx-auto grid max-w-[1120px] gap-6 px-4 py-12">
    <h2 class="m-0">Services</h2>
    <p class="max-w-[70ch]">
      We bring tailored technical solutions that drive performance and
      efficiency.
    </p>
    <div
      class="grid [grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr))] gap-4"
    >
      <article
        class="rounded-xl border border-[rgba(55,62,69,0.15)]/100 bg-white/75 p-4"
      >
        <h3 class="mt-0">1. E‑Commerce Solution Architecture</h3>
        <ul class="m-0 list-disc pl-5">
          <li>Technical leadership on new or migrating builds</li>
          <li>Scalable architecture for Shopify or Adobe Commerce</li>
          <li>Headless strategy and architecture planning</li>
          <li>Tech stack evaluation and recommendations</li>
        </ul>
      </article>
      <article
        class="rounded-xl border border-[rgba(55,62,69,0.15)]/100 bg-white/75 p-4"
      >
        <h3 class="mt-0">2. Custom App Development</h3>
        <ul class="m-0 list-disc pl-5">
          <li>Private and public Shopify apps</li>
          <li>Admin tools for operational automation</li>
          <li>Integration‑focused apps (CRM, ERP, WMS)</li>
          <li>Custom APIs and secure backend services</li>
        </ul>
      </article>
      <article
        class="rounded-xl border border-[rgba(55,62,69,0.15)]/100 bg-white/75 p-4"
      >
        <h3 class="mt-0">3. Headless Commerce Builds</h3>
        <ul class="m-0 list-disc pl-5">
          <li>Headless Shopify with Next.js, Remix, Hydrogen</li>
          <li>CMS integrations (Sanity, Contentful, and more)</li>
          <li>Performance for Lighthouse & Core Web Vitals</li>
          <li>Full deployment and CI/CD strategy</li>
        </ul>
      </article>
      <article
        class="rounded-xl border border-[rgba(55,62,69,0.15)]/100 bg-white/75 p-4"
      >
        <h3 class="mt-0">4. Custom Feature Development</h3>
        <ul class="m-0 list-disc pl-5">
          <li>Checkout customization and upsell features</li>
          <li>Bundling, subscriptions, loyalty integrations</li>
          <li>UI/UX enhancements across desktop and mobile</li>
          <li>Theme development or headless frontend work</li>
        </ul>
      </article>
      <article
        class="rounded-xl border border-[rgba(55,62,69,0.15)]/100 bg-white/75 p-4"
      >
        <h3 class="mt-0">5. Systems Integration & Automation</h3>
        <ul class="m-0 list-disc pl-5">
          <li>ERP, CRM, and 3PL integrations (real‑time & batch)</li>
          <li>Sync inventory, orders, and customer data</li>
          <li>Workflow automation for marketing/fulfillment</li>
          <li>Webhooks, middleware, and third‑party connectors</li>
        </ul>
      </article>
      <article
        class="rounded-xl border border-[rgba(55,62,69,0.15)]/100 bg-white/75 p-4"
      >
        <h3 class="mt-0">6. Technical Audits & Strategy Consulting</h3>
        <ul class="m-0 list-disc pl-5">
          <li>Code reviews and performance audits</li>
          <li>Security and scalability assessments</li>
          <li>Platform migration planning</li>
          <li>Executive reporting and documentation</li>
        </ul>
      </article>
      <article
        class="rounded-xl border border-[rgba(55,62,69,0.15)]/100 bg-white/75 p-4"
      >
        <h3 class="mt-0">7. Fractional CTO Services</h3>
        <ul class="m-0 list-disc pl-5">
          <li>On‑demand technical leadership</li>
          <li>Strategic roadmap development</li>
          <li>Vendor management and hiring support</li>
          <li>Internal team mentorship and structure</li>
        </ul>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto grid max-w-[1120px] gap-4 px-4 pb-12">
    <h3 class="m-0">Add‑On Services</h3>
    <ul class="m-0 max-w-[960px] list-disc [columns:2] gap-8 pl-5">
      <li>API documentation and handoff packages</li>
      <li>DevOps and CI/CD setup for in‑house teams</li>
      <li>Shopify Plus and Adobe Commerce onboarding</li>
      <li>Technical SEO reviews and schema integration</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section id="approach" class="mx-auto grid max-w-[1120px] gap-4 px-4 py-12">
    <h2 class="m-0">Approach</h2>
    <p class="max-w-[70ch]">
      Integrity first. We start with discovery and honest diagnostics,
      prioritize high-leverage improvements, and build in short, measurable
      cycles. Transparent comms, clear tradeoffs, and code built to last.
    </p>
    <ul
      class="grid list-none [grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(240px,1fr))] gap-3 p-0"
    >
      <li
        class="rounded-lg border-l-4 border-[--color-supporting-green] bg-white/65 px-3 py-2"
      >
        Discovery & technical audit
      </li>
      <li
        class="rounded-lg border-l-4 border-[--color-supporting-green] bg-white/65 px-3 py-2"
      >
        Roadmap with ROI focus
      </li>
      <li
        class="rounded-lg border-l-4 border-[--color-supporting-green] bg-white/65 px-3 py-2"
      >
        Build, measure, iterate
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section id="work" class="mx-auto grid max-w-[1120px] gap-4 px-4 py-12">
    <h2 class="m-0">Selected Work</h2>
    <p>Case studies coming soon. Ask for relevant examples in your industry.</p>
  </section>

  <section
    id="contact"
    class="mx-auto grid max-w-[1120px] gap-4 px-4 pt-12 pb-20"
  >
    <h2 class="m-0">Start a project</h2>
    <p class="max-w-[70ch]">
      Tell us where you are, what you’re building, and where you want to grow.
    </p>
    <form
      name="contact"
      method="POST"
      data-netlify="true"
      class="grid max-w-[640px] gap-3"
    >
      <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="contact" />
      <input
        required
        name="name"
        placeholder="Your name"
        class="rounded-lg border border-[rgba(55,62,69,0.2)] bg-white px-3 py-3"
      />
      <input
        required
        type="email"
        name="email"
        placeholder="Email"
        class="rounded-lg border border-[rgba(55,62,69,0.2)] bg-white px-3 py-3"
      />
      <textarea
        required
        name="message"
        placeholder="What can we help with?"
        rows="6"
        class="rounded-lg border border-[rgba(55,62,69,0.2)] bg-white px-3 py-3"
      ></textarea>
      <button
        class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-[--color-accent-brown] px-4 py-2 font-semibold text-white transition hover:opacity-90 active:translate-y-px"
        type="submit">Send</button
      >
    </form>
  </section>
</Layout>
